    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "opening.owner-transfer.asset.sprite.001",
        "actorId": "legacy.actor.u43cq5",
        "slot": "right",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "閉館前、私はマダムを登録窓口へ案内した。今日の仕事は、よく働いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "飲み物を運び、道を案内し、海を設備担当へ渡した。あとは勤務確認の印をもらえば終わる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.3fs2v8",
      "speakerName": "受付係ノノ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "権利返却ですね。では、返却審査中の現場代理人をお願いします。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.jsgxc9",
      "speakerName": "マダム",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "今日、現場にいる責任者の方でよろしいの?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.3fs2v8",
      "speakerName": "受付係ノノ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "はい。現場を確認できる方です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.jsgxc9",
      "speakerName": "マダム",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ではミミさん、お願いできる?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "勤務確認ですね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三人とも、同じ話をしている顔だった。魔法盤の欄は「現場代理人」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "、派遣票は「本日の現場責任者」とある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "双子なら、せめて別々の服を着てほしいくらい似ている。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "今日ここで働いたことを確認すればいいんですね?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.3fs2v8",
      "speakerName": "受付係ノノ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "はい。こちらへ社員証を。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "opening.owner-transfer.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "flash"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "社員証を置く。盤面が青く光り、「返却手続き」の文字が消えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "代わりに、私の名前が出た。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "暫定オーナー　ミミ。耳が、ひくっと跳ねた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私の勤務確認、ずいぶん偉くなっていませんか?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.jsgxc9",
      "speakerName": "マダム",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "まあ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.3fs2v8",
      "speakerName": "受付係ノノ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "少々お待ちください。返却審査中の代理人が、暫定オーナーとして登録されています。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノノさんは魔法盤を見た。マダムは私を見た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.015b",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.015b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は社員証を見た。社員証は何も悪くない顔をしていた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.jsgxc9",
      "speakerName": "マダム",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "すぐ戻してちょうだい。この方は今日、働きに来ただけなのよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.017a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.017a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.3fs2v8",
      "speakerName": "受付係ノノ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "訂正申請を出します。ただ、今夜の締め処理が終わるまで権利盤へ触れません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.018a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.018a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.jsgxc9",
      "speakerName": "マダム",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "本当にごめんなさい。せめてお詫びに、お茶とコロシアム銘菓を届けさせて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.019a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.019a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "手渡された箱には『八つ裂き大福』と書いてあった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.019b",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.019b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "割れ目から真っ赤ないちご蜜が垂れている。謝罪の品としては、事件性が高い。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.020a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.020a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ありがとうございます。味は平和なんですね?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.021a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.021a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.jsgxc9",
      "speakerName": "マダム",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "評判はとてもいいのよ。見た目以外は。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.022a",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.022a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "派遣初日の帰り際に、三日分ほどの闘技場を持たされた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.022b",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.022b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私とマダムとノノさんの勘違いが、きれいな三角形になっている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.line.022c",
      "lineId": "opening.owner-transfer.line.022c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "真ん中には、私の名前と、血のようないちご蜜があった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "opening.owner-transfer.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "opening.owner-transfer.choice.001",
          "label": "今すぐ訂正できる方法をノノへ聞く",
          "result": "訂正申請は、すぐ作ってもらえた。ただし処理には数日かかる。その間に使える権利は、問題が起きるたび、ひとつずつ確認することになった。",
          "intent": "まず正規の訂正手続きを確認する",
          "promise": "名義訂正を進めながら、必要な権利だけを一つずつ知る。",
          "memory": "最初に制度へ確認を求めたことが、後の問い合わせ方へ残る。",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [],
          "goto": "opening.owner-transfer.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "opening.owner-transfer.choice.002",
          "label": "マダムが何を返そうとしたのか聞く",
          "result": "マダムは饗会の宝くじで当てた権利を、会社へ返すだけのつもりだった。押しつける意図がなかったことを、本人の言葉で確かめた。",
          "intent": "前オーナーの意図を確かめる",
          "promise": "誰かを責める前に、三人の理解がどこでずれたかを知る。",
          "memory": "マダムの善意を先に確かめたことが、翌日のお詫びへつながる。",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [],
          "goto": "opening.owner-transfer.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "opening.owner-transfer.choice.003",
          "label": "三人で「現場代理人」の欄を読み直す",
          "result": "三人が、それぞれ別の意味で読んでいたことだけは、完全に一致した。分かりやすい説明へ直すよう、訂正申請と一緒に要望を出した。",
          "intent": "誤登録の原因を三人で確かめる",
          "promise": "誰か一人の不注意にせず、紛らわしい手続きそのものを記録する。",
          "memory": "三人で同じ欄を読み直した時間が、最初の共同作業として残る。",
          "tone": "comic",
          "effects": [],
          "goto": "opening.owner-transfer.node.effect.001"
        }
      ]
    },
